NewGameOverEvent:
EVBIT_MODIFY 4
FADI 10
CLEA 0; CLEN 0; CLEE 0
LOMA Chapter1
TILECHANGE 0x0
LOAD1 0x1 NewGameOverUnit; ENUN
SVAL 0x1 99
SET_HP Nathan
FADU 5
STAL 45
CHECK_CLASS Nathan
SVAL 0x1 Warlock
BEQ 0x1 0xc 0x1
SoloText(GameOverText); GOTO 0x2
LABEL 0x1; SoloText(GameOverTextPromoted)
LABEL 0x2; STAL 30; SFXKillUnit(Nathan); STAL 30
ASMC $8085375
ENDA

PiorinGameOver:
MUSC 0x0
EVBIT_MODIFY 4
FADI 10
CLEA 0; CLEN 0; CLEE 0
LOMA Chapter1
TILECHANGE 0x0
LOAD1 0x1 PiorinGameOverUnit; ENUN
SVAL 0x1 99
SET_HP Nathan
FADU 5
STAL 45
SoloText(PiorinGameOverText); STAL 30; SFXKillUnit(Nathan); STAL 30
ASMC $8085375
ENDA

